<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 18.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 18.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 18     June 17   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  273.000     274.250     247.020   10.52 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.310     309.090     306.830    0.81 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.315     158.000     158.970   -0.41 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.904	46.844	47.182   -0.59 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  447.120     448.980     419.180    6.67 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.790     140.500     141.685   -0.63 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.156	16.152	16.185   -0.18 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  241.410     241.280     212.430   13.64 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.879	 1.872	 1.888   -0.48 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.568	 1.567	 1.581   -0.82 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.160     189.400     183.135    3.29 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
